 Haven, Connecticut. It has been there since the 1970s when Robert A. Maletsky, a curator at Yale, donated it to the library. The manuscript undergoes careful preservation and is available for scholarly research and viewing under specific conditions."}, {"key": [123, 3, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -3.2424628768133227e-09, "log_surv_s": -6.840821109529217e-09, "gen_len": 124, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [340, 2, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.8378440148865079e-06, "log_surv_s": -4.51510559981631e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [340, 2, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -1.7358724385022147e-06, "log_surv_s": -4.095600658215893e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [340, 2, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -4.406201906994289e-06, "log_surv_s": -7.014965280037531e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [340, 2, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.1702153925127927e-06, "log_surv_s": -3.6885033552469473e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [493, 2, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -2.7664606727800884e-08, "log_surv_s": -5.3552593478251514e-08, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [493, 2, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -5.799304714645162e-08, "log_surv_s": -1.569903358438104e-07, "gen_len": 498, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [493, 2, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -7.516473663170793e-08, "log_surv_s": -1.1428504551475316e-06, "gen_len": 505, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [493, 2, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.5232211316073952e-08, "log_surv_s": -1.1497167877765011e-07, "gen_len": 400, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [103, 2, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -2.2097282178455187e-08, "log_surv_s": -8.68496394723089e-08, "gen_len": 370, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [103, 2, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -4.9509737392789665e-09, "log_surv_s": -1.5370356451315753e-08, "gen_len": 309, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [103, 2, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -1.7307933925720753e-08, "log_surv_s":